<title>USA: Fed bought coupons Dec 31, 1997 thru May 31, 1999.</title>
<headline>Fed bought coupons Dec 31, 1997 thru May 31, 1999.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve bought coupons dated from December 31, 1997 through May 31, 1999 on Wednesday, a Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>The purchases added permanent reserves to the banking system.</p>
<p>(( -- North American Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
